| `agents/index_enforcer/` | Enforces conventions and builds the accountable wiki corpus. Failed owner status, unreadable owner lists and a nonzero structure gate without error lines raise the shared `ToolReportUnreadable` before later work; absent-corpus JSON is `[]`. | through `runtimes/` | [`corpus.served_visibilities`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | No command line of its own. A gap fill is one model call per gap, and `enforce(execute=True, fix_gaps=True)` with no approved count (`max_model_calls`) is a `ValueError`. A gap on a node at a level outside the served levels is never filled: it stays a reported gap and never reaches a prompt. | [agent-runtimes.md](../guides/agent-runtimes.md) | always |
